cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset and code, please cite the archived Zenodo release."
type: software
title: "PorcineSow-HR-HP-MiniDemo: minimal data and baseline for 5-min heat production prediction in pregnant sows"
abstract: >
  A minimal reproducibility kit pairing 5-min heart-rate-derived and motion
  features with indirect-calorimetry heat production on pregnant sows, with
  a gradient-boosted tree baseline and 5-fold cross-validation.
